        "created_at": "2013-03-24T14:38:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>On Friday, I had to pleasure of introducing SotM to about ten people.&nbsp; I think everyone enjoyed the game, at least those who were vocal about it enjoyed the game quite a bit.</p><p>It turns out that two or three of the players there are heavily involved in U-Con, a local gaming convention.&nbsp; I expect that &gt;G may be contacted shortly to see if you wish to paricipate. If you are, fabulous! I look forward to meeting y'all.&nbsp; If not, I'm happy to set up open games, and would look for any advice you might be able to give on doing so.</p><p>http://www.ucon-gaming.org/</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
